{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>כשכיר</b> — two times in the Masorah, and the other is עד ירצה כשכיר יומו. A hint to what the Sages said: a hired worker may withdraw even at midday. That is, כשכיר יהיה עמך — until he wishes; and even ביומו, if he wishes, he may withdraw."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:34.762173378Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}